      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DELIZIOSO (4) will find this easier than her last attempt when midfield in a Victoria Oaks heat. Was first up for 11 months when she came from wider than this and raced parked but fought to miss narrowly here prior. Yet to miss a place at this distance and should be close to her peak now. BETTORBUST (5) made good progress to win when second-up last week, drawing on the back row and racing wide without cover before getting home by more than 8 metres at Mildura. Leading hope. ASHANTE WARRIOR (2) broke the maiden two back before a respectable second at his most recent appearance at Melton, both from wider barriers than this. ATOMIK GO ANNA (10) cops a tricky draw but has been tackling some good juveniles since her Wagga win last month so could measure up here.",
